/*!
\page ce__infolabels CoreELEC Info Labels

CoreELEC specific info labels, registered through the CoreELEC label registry
(CEGUIInfoRegistry.h) instead of the upstream label tables.

\table_start
  \table_h3{ Labels, Type, Description }
