  \table_row3{   <b>`Player.Process(video.dovi.flags)`</b>,
                 \anchor Player_Process_video_dovi_flags
                 _string_,
    @return Active player transformations as space separated tokens out of converted (profile 7 or 4
    to 8.1 conversion)\, l5zeroed (L5 offsets zeroed)\, rpuremoved (metadata removed for a display
    without Dolby Vision\, labels keep reporting what the stream carries) and compressed (stream
    uses metadata compression\, source PQ values not sent on compressed frames). The integer form is
    a bitmask in the same order.
    <p><hr>
    @skinning_v22 **[New Infolabel]** \link Player_Process_video_dovi_flags `Player.Process(video.dovi.flags)`\endlink
    <p>
  }
